i></ul><a name=\"opt-item.Ccc.A.DE24\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for Ccc.A.DE24 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE25 (\"Mother\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE26 (\"Father\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE27 (\"Sibling\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE28 (\"Extended family\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE29 (\"Legal Guardian\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE30 (\"Not Related\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.Ccc.A.DE31\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for Ccc.A.DE31 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE46 (\"Dead\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE34 (\"Alive\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE33 (\"Unknown\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.Ccc.A.DE32\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for Ccc.A.DE32 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE46 (\"Dead\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE34 (\"Alive\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/CodeSystem/Ccc-custom-codes#Ccc.A.DE33 (\"Unknown\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.Ccc.A.DE38\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for Ccc.A.DE38 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">null#Ccc.A.DE38 (\"Caregiver wants to receive SMS or other messages regarding the child's visits and health status\")</li></ul></div>"
